          <mxGeometry x="50" y="660" width="150" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="exampleBox" value="&lt;b&gt;【场景】新用户首次登录&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. 前端请求 - wx.getUserProfile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;输入: 无（用户点击授权）&lt;br/&gt;输出: {&lt;br/&gt;  nickName: '张三',&lt;br/&gt;  avatarUrl: 'https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/xxx',&lt;br/&gt;  gender: 1&lt;br/&gt;}&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. 调用云函数 - user.login&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;请求参数: {action: 'login', userInfo: {...}}&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. 云函数处理过程&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• 获取 OPENID: 'oXGxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx'&lt;br/&gt;• 查询 users 集合: 无记录（新用户）&lt;br/&gt;• 创建新用户: {openid, age:25, height:170, weight:65, activityLevel:3, goal:'maintain'}&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. 云函数响应&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;{&lt;br/&gt;  openid: 'oXGxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx',&lt;br/&gt;  nickname: '张三',&lt;br/&gt;  avatar: 'https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/xxx',&lt;br/&gt;  age: 25, height: 170, weight: 65,&lt;br/&gt;  activityLevel: 3, goal: 'maintain',&lt;br/&gt;  isNewUser: true&lt;br/&gt;}&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. 前端处理结果&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• app.globalData.hasLogin = true&lt;br/&gt;• app.globalData.openid = 'oXGxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx'&lt;br/&gt;• 跳转至新手引导页（资料不完整）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f4f8;strokeColor=#4a90e2;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="700" width="380" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>